         import urllib.request,sys                                              
         try:                                                                   
             print(urllib.request.urlopen('http://127.0.0.1:7001/').getcode())  
         except Exception as e:                                                 
             print("ERROR:", e); sys.exit(1)                                    
         PY                                                                     
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
